<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Your Montra account recovery code</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#faf8f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all">Your code works once and expires in 30 minutes.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#faf8f4"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px">
<tr><td style="padding:0 4px 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1f5d4c">Montra</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e6e0d6;border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1a17">Someone asked to recover the Montra account for this email address. Your recovery code:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:14px 16px;background:#f2f6f3;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:#1c1a17;text-align:center">{{ .RecoveryCode }}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1a17">Enter it on the page where you asked for it. It works once and expires in 30 minutes.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1a17">After you recover your account, you’ll still need your second factor if you have one set up, and every other session will be signed out.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1a17">If this wasn’t you, ignore this email. Your password hasn’t changed. Montra staff will never ask for this code.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 4px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5e574e">You’re getting this because it’s about the security of your Montra account. Security emails can’t be turned off.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
